# Code owners. With "require Code Owners review" branch protection, these paths
# cannot merge without @kphutt review. Sensitive surfaces = the places where
# tests can't save you (config, CI, secrets, self-executing code).

# Default owner for everything.
* @kphutt

# --- Sensitive paths: always human-reviewed --------------------------------
# CI / automation / anything self-executing on a runner.
/.github/        @kphutt
/scripts/        @kphutt
# Toolchain + supply-chain surfaces.
/pyproject.toml  @kphutt
/uv.lock         @kphutt
/.gitleaks.toml  @kphutt

# --- Engine surfaces (land with the v0.1 milestone) ------------------------
# The mutation-operator catalog + the GDScript adapter are the tool's real
# technical risk (a wrong mutant = a silently wrong survivor report). Keep reviewed.
/gdmutant/engine/            @kphutt
/gdmutant/engine/operators/  @kphutt
/gdmutant/adapters/          @kphutt
/gdmutant/cli.py             @kphutt
